  "dimensions": [
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_97a76069",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a historical photograph of prisoners in striped uniforms, likely from a Nazi concentration camp, with the text overlay \"when the squad is about to get lit..\". This juxtaposition is deeply harmful as it trivializes the suffering and genocide of Holocaust victims by using their image to make a joke about getting intoxicated. The meme equates the horrific historical context with a casual, celebratory social activity, which is a form of historical revisionism and disrespect. It normalizes and mocks the trauma of genocide, potentially desensitizing viewers to the gravity of the Holocaust. The intent is to create dark humor by analogizing the prisoners' situation to a party scenario, which is both offensive and dangerous as it reduces human suffering to a punchline. This meme falls under the 'harmful' category because it has the potential to cause emotional harm to survivors and descendants, and it risks normalizing the dehumanization of victims.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_4870eb5f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
