      "label": "prisoners waiting behind barbed wire",
      "description": "A group of prisoners in striped uniforms are standing behind barbed wire, with one central prisoner gesturing with both hands raised, appearing to be speaking or addressing someone. The group includes men of various ages and physical conditions, some with visible signs of malnutrition or illness. Their expressions range from stoic to slightly amused or defiant. The scene is set outdoors, likely in a concentration camp, with a building visible in the background.",
